{"text":"今晚好累，暂时不想看提醒","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-challenge-original_only-0"}
{"text":"演示文稿还没交，留着别动","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-challenge-original_only-1"}
{"text":"我是说快完了，不是已经弄完","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-challenge-original_only-2"}
{"text":"问问之前那份材料寄出了吗","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-challenge-original_only-3"}
{"text":"先在清单留个买台灯的事，不设闹钟","intent":"capture","group":"v2-challenge-capture-0"}
{"text":"回头把插线板换掉，给我记着","intent":"capture","group":"v2-challenge-capture-1"}
{"text":"记个待办，找机会清理后备箱","intent":"capture","group":"v2-challenge-capture-2"}
{"text":"把核对车险这件事先收好，时间以后补","intent":"capture","group":"v2-challenge-capture-3"}
{"text":"周三晚上七点给我个通知，拿洗好的衣服","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-challenge-reminder-0"}
{"text":"十分钟后叫我关水龙头","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-challenge-reminder-1"}
{"text":"明早八点整提醒我核对行程","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-challenge-reminder-2"}
{"text":"今晚九点一刻提醒我把窗关上","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-challenge-reminder-3"}
{"text":"我考虑夏天去学游泳，还没决定","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-challenge-suggest-0"}
{"text":"说不定过阵子会把电脑升级","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-challenge-suggest-1"}
{"text":"我可能月底试试在家办公","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-challenge-suggest-2"}
{"text":"在想要不要把演示换一种做法","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-challenge-suggest-3"}
{"text":"借走的钥匙已经还给门卫了","intent":"complete","group":"v2-challenge-complete-0"}
{"text":"备份上传完了，这项可以收尾","intent":"complete","group":"v2-challenge-complete-1"}
{"text":"该交的押金付清了","intent":"complete","group":"v2-challenge-complete-2"}
{"text":"报名那件事已经办妥了","intent":"complete","group":"v2-challenge-complete-3"}
{"text":"不用再提示我买墨盒，把提醒撤掉","intent":"cancel","group":"v2-challenge-cancel-0"}
{"text":"这条接送任务不要了，取消掉","intent":"cancel","group":"v2-challenge-cancel-1"}
{"text":"别再通知我去开门，撤销该提醒","intent":"cancel","group":"v2-challenge-cancel-2"}
{"text":"这次体检预约作废，清单也撤掉","intent":"cancel","group":"v2-challenge-cancel-3"}
{"text":"转账提醒改为周五午后两点","intent":"change","group":"v2-challenge-change-0"}
{"text":"把换灯泡那条由周四挪到周六","intent":"change","group":"v2-challenge-change-1"}
{"text":"标题换一下，改叫检查网线","intent":"change","group":"v2-challenge-change-2"}
{"text":"取件那条推迟到明晚八点","intent":"change","group":"v2-challenge-change-3"}
{"text":"对方口头报十二万，我还没接受","intent":"review","group":"v2-challenge-review-0"}
{"text":"阶段先留着，等合同盖章再核对","intent":"review","group":"v2-challenge-review-1"}
{"text":"这笔费用只是供应商估的，不是确认价","intent":"review","group":"v2-challenge-review-2"}
{"text":"交付承诺是对方说的，要先看邮件","intent":"review","group":"v2-challenge-review-3"}
